Rathion.wikitext:
{{BloodRavensPortal}}
'''Rathion''' is an [[Eradicator Marine]] in the [[Blood Ravens]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
He is ambitious and Rathion desires to prove his mettle to his [[Chapter]], so that he can rise up the [[Blood Ravens]]' ranks. Because of this, the [[Eradicator Marine]] is often the first to enter the fray and eagerly wields his [[Melta Rifle]] with terrifying efficiency. Rathion is now among the [[Blood Ravens]]' forces,{{Fn|1a}} that are purging the [[Ork]] horde which has overrun the [[Imperium]]'s [[Bastion Theta]] facility.{{Fn|1b}}

