Raths Luastus.wikitext:
{{EmperorsChildrenPortal}}
'''Raths Luastus''' was a [[Decurio]] of the [[Emperor's Children]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] active during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

==Biography==
Luastus was born on [[Terra]].{{Fn|1}} He eventually rose to the position of strike leader of one of his Legion's assault [[Space Marine Company|companies]]{{Fn|1}}, serving in the Legion's [[VIth Millennial]].{{Fn|2}}

He was among those of his Legion committed to the first wave of the [[Battle of Isstvan III]]. Luastus, however, did not live to see the [[Horus Heresy|great betrayal]], as he was killed during the initial phase of the battle by an Isstvanian [[war-singer]].{{Fn|1}}

