Ravael Orhlacc.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
'''Ravael Orhlacc''' was a [[Knight Scion]] of [[House Orhlacc]], who piloted the [[Knight Paladin]] ''[[Sorrowful Dawn]]''.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
During the [[Great Crusade]], Ravael fought a number of actions alongside the [[Space Marines]] of the [[Blood Angels|IX Legion]]. Later in the Crusade, Ravael was summoned back to House Orhlacc's [[Knight World|homeworld]], [[Dark Haven]], where he and ''Sorrowful Dawn'' became part of their world's garrison forces.{{Fn|1}}

After the [[Horus Heresy]] erupted, Ravael and ''Sorrowful Dawn'' were called on to fight once more, taking part in the [[Battle of the Coronid Deeps]]. In the course of the war, Ravael defeated at least eleven [[Traitor Knight]]s of [[House Makabius]] in battle.{{Fn|1}}

