Ravana (Archmagos).wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
'''Ravana''' is an [[Archmagos]] from the [[Calixis Sector]] [[Forge World]] [[Haddrack]], whose [[Ravana's Bloody-Handed Cogs|fleet]] is active in the [[Koronus Expanse]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
The [[Archmagos]] entered the [[Koronus Expanse|Expanse]] in 747.[[M41]], at the head of a small but powerful force of [[Explorator Fleet|Sollexian Adeptus Mechanicus Explorator]]s. They had splintered from the [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] on doctrinal grounds and quickly proved their willingness to fire on anyone, who stood in the way of their goals. Despite this, however, Ravana and her forces remained uncensored by the Mechanicus' overlords. This earned them the mocking nickname "[[Ravana's Bloody-Handed Cogs]]" for the crimson and gold [[Opus Machina]] graven on the hulls of their vessels. They were then placed in the popular imagination of the Koronus void-born, as little more than sanctioned [[pirate]]s. A reputation that still lasts to this day.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
