{{Fanatic}}
'''Red Dog''' is a [[Pirate]] leader.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He is attempting to seize control of an [[Imperial]] city, by using an [[Archeotech]] shield generator that the [[Rogue Trader]] [[Vogel (Rogue Trader)|Vogel]] has sold the [[Pirate]] leader. It is being installed within the city's '''Vamhorn Stadium''', but Red Dog will not pay Vogel, until the Archeotech is operational. As the two wait in the stadium for this to occur, the shield generator is being watched over by Vogel's hired thug [[Krystis]], and several of Red Dog's pirates. [[Inquisitor]] [[Bell (Inquisitor)|Bell]] though, knows about the Pirate leader's plans and he is racing to stop the shield generator from being activated.{{Fn|1}} 
