Red Widow.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
The '''Red Widow''' was a [[daemon]] dwelling in the void surrounding the world of [[Malodrax]].{{Fn|1}}

The Widow dwells within the coral-reef-like structures surrounding the planet, preying on wrecked ships. It had the appearance of an emaciated woman with a black void where its face should be. Gazing into the Widow's face was equivalent to gazing directly into the [[Warp]], and could entrance and distract the Widow's enemies. When attacking ships, the Red Widow was accompanied by weaker daemons known as [[Grey Hungers]].{{Fn|1}}

When the [[Imperial Fists]] returned to Malodrax led by [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Darnath Lysander]] to get revenge on the [[Iron Warriors]], the Red Widow and Grey Hungers attacked their ship. The daemons slaughtered many human crewmembers and even an injured Imperial Fist, but were ultimately banished.{{Fn|1}}

