Remiare.wikitext:
{{DarkMechanicumPortal}}
'''Remiare''' was a [[Dark Mechanicum]] [[Assassin]] during the [[Horus Heresy]]. Amongst the adepts of Mars, the name Remiare was well known and spelled Doom for its victims. She was tasked with the elimination of [[Adept]] [[Pallas Ravachol]] {{Fn|1b}}

==Description==
[[File:Remiare.jpg|thumb|right|250px|'''Remiare''' in flight{{Fn|1a}}]]
Born of the feminine gender, she was clad in a bodyglove of gleaming synthetic material that rippled like blood across its skin. She was athletic and toned through a vigorous regime of physical exercise, genetic manipulation and surgical augmentation. {{Fn|1b}}

Hardwired targeting apparatus grafted to the side of her skull made her a deadly killer and tife long snake-like sensor tendrils that swam in the air at her back ensured that she would always be able to track her prey. {{Fn|1b}}

Her legs were joined above the ankles by a spar of metal. Below the spar, her legs ended, not in feet, but in a complex series of magno-gravitic thrusters which alllowed her to take flight. {{Fn|1b}}

