'''Retius Daceus'''{{Fn|2}} is a [[Veteran Sergeant]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]], the right-hand man of [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Cato Sicarius]], and the leader of his [[Space Marine Command Squad|Command Squad]], the "[[Lions of Macragge]]."{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==

Several weeks after the [[Damnos Incident]] Daceus was back on [[Macragge]]. After [[Sicarius]] had woken from his revivification casket he had Daceus join him, [[Agemman]] and [[Vantor]] on their way to the armorium. There Dacues helped them shoot at the remains of [[Necrons]] from [[Damnos]] they had brought back that were self repairing. He then looked over the remains to make sure they were dead with [[Sicarius]].{{Fn|4}}

At some point after the [[Damnos Incident]] Daceus participated in the defense of a world against the [[Tyranids]]. He advised [[Sicarius]] against his plan to take a [[Vanguard Veteran]] squad to the planet via drop pod, and assassinate the nodal creature, though [[Sicarius]] ignored his advice. Later Daceus went out in a [[Storm Raven]] looking for him, when he found the crashed [[Drop Pod]] he thought Sicarius might be dead, though he found him shortly after.{{Fn|5}}

