Reynaard.wikitext:
{{OrdoXenosPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Ordo Xenos]] [[Inquisitor]] who discovered a [[Xenophile Cult|Xenos-worshiping cult]] in the capital city of the [[Imperium]] world [[Mandall IV]].{{Fn|1}}

The Inquisitor first thought the [[Xenos]] worshipers were localized within a particular district, but when Reynaard led a [[Deathwatch]] [[Kill-Team]] against the cult, the entire city turned upon them. After they barely escaped from the city with their lives, {{PAGENAME}} gathered reinforcements and returned to Mandall IV's capital with over a half a million soldiers to dispose of the cult. At the Inquisitor's command the soldiers laid waste to the capital city and its population, ensuring that no trace of it ever existing remained.{{Fn|1}}

