Ricter Mortis.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Ricter Mortis''' is a [[Black Templars]] [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|Canon Conflict}}
==History==
He took part{{Fn|1}} in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|2}} [[Gathrog Campaign]],{{Fn|3}} against the invading [[Orks]] of the [[Green Kroosade]].{{Fn|2}} Mortis was among those the [[Ordo Xenos]] gathered information on during the conflict, but it was made classified by the Ordo.{{Fn|1}} While the Gathrog Campaign later ended in failure,{{Fn|2}} the [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]] survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''Ricter Mortis'' was created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]], by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Jersey Gardens''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''Elizabeth, New Jersey, USA'''.{{Fn|3}}
