Roderick.wikitext:
[[Image:Roderick.jpg|thumb|right|250px|Roderick{{Fn|1}}]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Imperial]] [[Knight]] of [[House Cadmus]] who pilots the [[Knight Paladin]] ''Hound of Raisa''.{{Fn|1}}

A skilled pilot and pitiless hunter, he is favoured by his lance-brother and current ruler of House Cadmus, [[Roland]]. Renowned for his ruthless zeal against [[Abhuman]]s, some attribute this to the fact that his parents were killed by such creatures during the House's Culling ritual while the pair traveled to Golem's Keep on [[Raisa]]. The tale continues that Roderick escaped into the woods and was taken in by a wild hunter. Whatever the truth, he went on to reclaim his birthright, taking up his parent's privileges and rising high within the House. He has hunted foes on countless worlds, such as [[Ork]]s on [[Kane's Sorrow]] and [[Tyranid]]s on [[Galfranus V]].{{Fn|1}}

