'''Roland''' is a [[Knight]] [[Baron]] and ruler of [[House Cadmus]].{{Fn|1}}

A Born of an old and powerful family, he is an uncompromising man who doesn't suffer the presence of fools. In times of war, he leads the Knights of Cadmus from the front, resplendent in his modified [[Knight Lancer]] armor. Unusually, Roland chooses to pilot [[Knight Errant]] armour when competing in the House Cadmus ritual known as The Cull, unwilling to claim an unfair advantage over his rivals by using a suit afforded to him by his rank. However, his unbroken run of thirty-two victories has long since silenced any critics who claimed he did not take the Cull seriously.{{Fn|1}}

