'''Rosemaera Grace''' is a [[Canoness]] of the [[Order of the Argent Shroud]], who led its forces defending the [[Imperial]] world [[Crescent VI]].{{Fn|1}} 

In the wake of the [[Great Rift]]'s creation, though, the world was left isolated by [[Warp Storm]]s and a growing number of its population fell to [[Heresy]]. As the [[Psychic Awakening]] raged, [[Canoness]] Grace's [[Battle Sister|Sister]]s began to be heavily outnumbered by the [[Heretics]], despite their continuous culling, and send out a plea for aid. She asked, however, that only those strong in their faith come to aid [[Crescent VI]], lest they too be found wanting. She did not know if the Imperium even still existed, but if it did not then the [[Emperor]] would see that Grace and her Sisters remained faithful to the end.{{Fn|1}}

