Rutger Haruto.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Rutger Haruto''' is a [[Guardsman]] of the [[Catachan CMIII]] [[Regiment]], who serves as the orderly to [[Major]] [[Wulf Khan]]. She considered him to be incredibly sharp, but this was impacted by Haruto's stubbornness, which had both aided and inconvenienced her.{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
In [[M42]], the [[Catachan CMIII]] was among the [[Imperial]] forces that unsuccessfully defended [[Lazulai]] from a [[Tyranid]] invasion. As the world began to fall to the [[Xenos]], after months of warfare, the [[Regiment]]'s remaining hundreds of [[Guardsmen]] were defending '''Cobalt Fortress''' under [[Major]] [[Wulf Khan|Khan]]'s command. The Fortress itself was led by the [[Cadian 2012th]] [[General]] [[Kvelter]] and was one of the last left on Lazulai. However with the world deemed to be beyond saving, no further reinforcements would be sent to the surviving Imperial forces there. As Lazulai was being consumed by the Tyranids, though, cracks began showing between the Fortress' Regiments. This became an issue after [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]] [[Bligh (Captain)|Bligh]], of the Cadian 2012th, brought charges of infringement of discipline, breach of the disciplinary code and insubordination against Adair, for her actions during an attack on the Fortress. He was going to execute her for this, but Haruto was able to inform Major Khan about what was happening, before the Captain could do so. This allowed the Major to intervene in time to save Adair's life and free her from Bligh's grasp.{{Fn|1}}  

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Deathworlder (Novel)]], Chapter 1

