Ruvasta Paledes.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Ruvasta Paledes''' is a member of the [[Adeptus Custodes]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He is a member of [[Shield-Captain]] [[Dmytrosian]]'s [[Shield Company]], which has been charged with killing a witch-lord within the [[Gulfs of Edhali]]. This was after the [[Oracle of High Asiatica]] prophesied that the [[heretic]] would rise to become a threat to the [[Emperor]]. Their journey aboard the warship [[Nemesis (Warship)|Nemesis]] has been fraught with danger and they have had to [[Voyage of the Nemesis|fight several battles]] along the way, as they race towards their target. This included the [[Imperium]]'s [[Vigilum Station]] [[Space Station|deep-void watchtower]], where they found no one to greet them. The reason for this silence was discovered when the [[Custodians]] were attacked by unclean malevolent entities. In the battle that followed, Paledes along with [[Khiviqaria]] and [[Leihng]], would earn themselves new names for the deeds they committed there.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Codex: Adeptus Custodes (10th Edition)]], pg.105 - ''Crusade Rules''
