Rynart.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Rynart the Unbowed''' was a [[Black Templars]] [[Emperor's Champion]] in 563.[[M38]].{{Fn|1}}

On the storm-wracked world of [[Ismas]], Rynart led the charge against the cursed [[Ork]] hordes of [[Warboss]] [[Slagrut]]. Astride his clanking, smoking war machine, the Ork leader assaulted the [[Imperial]] lines across the great Ismas Steam Bridge linking the vast central canal-cities together. Rynart walked across a river of [[xenos]] corpses to smite the alien warlord, his [[Black Sword]] smashing apart the pistons and gears of its war engine. In the end, only a blow against the bridge itself was enough and, rupturing the compression spire, Rynart sent the Ork warlord and his horde screaming into the black waters below.{{Fn|1}}

