Sa'ra'am.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Daemon]], known by various titles such as ''The Daemon Beneath'', ''The Knife's Edge'', and the ''Laughter of War'', Sa'ra'am claims to have been created when the first mortal made a tool with the purpose of taking another life.{{Fn|1}}

Since then, he has only grown stronger as weapons have grown and developed. At some point, Sa'ra'am was bound within the [[Forge World]] of [[Sarum]], a fate that he secretly relishes as it allows him to remain free of the direct control of the [[Ruinous Powers]].{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Horus Heresy]], [[Perturabo]] journeyed to Sarum and met with Sa'ra'am in order to discover the location of [[Angron]]. The Daemon eventually revealed the [[Daemon Primarch]] to be on the world of [[Deluge]], then possessed the body of the [[Iron Warrior]] [[Volk]], creating the first [[Obliterator]].{{Fn|1}}

