Saal'zara.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Saal'zara''' was a powerful [[Asuryani]] [[Farseer]], who went to battle aboard a flame-covered [[Eldar Jetbike|jetbike]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among{{Fn|1}} the species' forces that invaded the [[Chinchare sub-sector]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However the [[Imperium]] later launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]] against the invading [[Asuryani]]{{Fn|2}} and Saal'zara was made one of its priority targets. During the conflict, the [[Farseer]]'s powerful [[warp]] signature, was detected by the Imperium's [[Sanctioned Psyker]]s at the location of four destroyed [[Colony World|colonies]]. Thus it was believed that Saal'zara was responsible for these massacres and an order of '''Xenos Exterminatus''' was declared against the Farseer. This later led Saal'zara to be killed by the Imperium's forces, during one of the Campaign's battles.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''Saal'zara'' was created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]] by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Austin Street''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''Austin, Texas, USA'''.{{Fn|3}}

