Sabrina.wikitext:
{{EcclesiarchyPortal}}
'''Sabrina''' is an [[Abbess of the Adepta Sororitas|Abbess]]{{Fn|1}} of the [[Convent Sanctorum]] and a [[Canoness]] of the [[Adepta Sororitas]].{{Fn|2}}

She was originally member of the [[Order of the Ermine Mantle]] in [[M41]]. Eventually became [[Abbess of the Adepta Sororitas]], but mysteriously vanished during pilgrimage to [[San Leor]]. After disappearance, the post of Abbess has remained vacant.{{Fn|1}}

Later in the [[Age of the Dark Imperium]] Sabrina's fate was revealed. As a [[Canoness]] she and her Sisters had become trapped on San Leor, battling [[Daemon]]s and the [[Alpha Legion]]. Though a century had passed, they were kept alive due to the powers of the [[Warp]] and a church bell which emanated with the powers of the [[Emperor]]. In the final phase of the [[Battle of San Leor]] Sabrina and her Sisters were encountered by [[Saint Celestine]], [[Greyfax]], and others. However the Imperial reinforcements were not enough to fully liberate the world, and Sabrina and her sisters agreed to stay behind to defend San Leor.{{Fn|2}}

