Saegius Mindblighter.wikitext:
{{WordBearersPortal}}
'''Saegius Mindblighter''' is a [[Word Bearers]] [[Chaos Lord]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
When the [[Imperial]] world [[Uphrateus]] was enveloped by the [[Eye of Terror]], Mindblighter was among the [[Chaos]] forces that invaded the doomed world afterwards. With the aid of his [[Word Bearers]], Mindblighter constructed a necropolis upon Uphrateus, which contained a cathedral where the [[Chaos Lord]] gave his heretical sermons. However the world had been the [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]] of the [[Sentinels of Uphrateus]] [[Chapter]], who still lived and remained loyal to the Imperium. They had been waging a campaign to reclaim their fallen world, from the Chaos invaders and this led the Sentinels to attack Mindblighter's forces. Despite suffering grievous casualties, the Chapter was eventually able to breach the defenses of the Chaos Lord's cathedral and in doing so, they also weakened the grip the [[Eye of Terror]] had on their Homeworld. This allowed Uphrateus to break free of the Eye and after 200 years, it returned to [[Realspace]], which was soon discovered by the [[Imperium]].{{Fn|1}}  

As the world had also once served as as a bastion against [[Chaos]] incursions from the [[Eye of Terror]], the [[Imperium]] launched a major operation to reclaim it. When the Imperials arrived at Uphrateus, though, they learned that not only was Uphrateus heavily corrupted, but that it also contained numerous Chaos forces. They also discovered that the [[Sentinels of Uphrateus]] still lived and had remained loyal to the Imperium. However operatives of the [[Scholastica Psykana]] became alarmed about the Sentinels' battle within Mindblighter's cathedral, as the [[Chaos Lord]] was manipulating the bloodshed in order to summon a vast [[Daemon]] host of [[Khorne]] to his aid. Seeing a full picture of Uphrateus' fate, led the Imperium to send two of the [[Space Wolves]] [[Great Companies]] to aid their forces, but they would not arrive in time stop the Chaos Lord's summoning. In desperation, the [[Officio Assassinorum]] was ordered to send the [[Eversor Assassin]] [[Tormentius]] to Uphrateus, in order to eliminate Mindblighter. Once the Eversor arrives there, the Imperium has estimated that Tormentius will have three hours to infiltrate the Chaos Lord's cathedral and kill Mindblighter, before his summoning is completed.{{Fn|1}}   

==Trivia==
''Saegius Mindblighter'', the [[Sentinels of Uphrateus]], their [[Uphrateus|Homeworld]] and [[Tormentius]], were created by the [[Games Workshop]] employees [[Wayne England]] and [[Ian Pickstock]] for [[Inferno! 1]].{{Fn|1}}

