Sael Karros.wikitext:
{{RavenGuardPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] in the [[Raven Guard]] [[4th Company (Raven Guard)|4th Company]].{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
[[Image:Sael.jpg|thumb|right|160px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
Commanding Raven Guard forces in the [[Invasion of the Odoacer System]] alongside the [[Imperial Fists]] under [[Heyd Calder]] and [[White Scars]] under [[Suboden Khan]], Karros accepted Calder's command and was the best suited of the trio to navigate the politics of the [[Cardinal World]] of [[Almace]].{{Fn|1a}} He was the first to suspect [[Cardinal]] [[Eamon]] was hiding something, eventually revealed to be an imprisoned [[Word Bearers]] [[Dreadnought]] dubbed [[The Anchorite]].{{Fn|1b}}  Karros was also able to organize criminal elements on Almace to raise more manpower to resist the Word Bearers.{{Fn|1c}}

Karros' most significant actions occur way from Almace, leading his [[Reiver]]s in raiding rebel-controlled asteroid mining facilities to deny the Word Bearers a staging point. When faced with a Word Bearers assault, he laid a series a booby traps and ambushes to blunt them and withdraw.{{Fn|1d}} When the [[Dark Apostle]] [[Lakmhu]] arrived to personally oversee the conquest of the asteroid facility, Karros was able to defeat his forces using explosive traps.{{Fn|1e}}

Karros' efforts in thea steroid belt were instrumental to the victory at Almace, as he significantly delayed the Word Bearers invasion fleet long enough for Calder and Suboden to organize an effective defense on Almace.{{Fn|1f}}

