Sama'el.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Sama'el''' was an [[Asuryani]] [[Exarch]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among{{Fn|1}} the species' forces that invaded the [[Chinchare sub-sector]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However the [[Imperium]] later launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]] against the invading [[Asuryani]]{{Fn|2}} and Sama'el was made one of its priority targets. The [[Exarch]] was also among those that the [[Ordo Xenos]] gathered information on during the conflict, but it was made classified by the Ordo. Sama'el would later be killed by the Imperium, during one of the Campaign's battles.{{Fn|1}} 
