{{DeathwatchPortal}}
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Sanctimus''' was a [[Space Marines|Space Marine]] of the [[Deathwatch]], hailing from the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

Sanctimus was one of the Deathwatch Marines aboard the [[Strike Cruiser]] ''[[Incontrovertible Truth]]'' when it was ambushed by ships of the [[Black Legion]].{{Fn|1}}

As the [[Chaos Space Marine]]s crippled and boarded the vessel, Sanctimus was one of a group of Marines who were prevented from joining [[Watch Captain]] [[Gharvil]] in repelling the boarders by damage to the ship, along with [[Antor Delassio]], [[Casella]], [[Grennon]] and [[Lokar]]. He clashed with Lokar multiple times over the next course of action to take after Gharvil was slain. Ultimately, Sanctimus and the Marines with him attempted to set ambushes of their own in order to bring down the invaders.{{Fn|1}}

Sanctimus was killed by the Chaos Marines during one of these attempted ambushes.{{Fn|1}}

