'''Sangrill''' was a [[Sword Brother]] of the [[Black Templars]], serving under [[Space Marine Sergeant|Brother-Sergeant]] [[Janus (Black Templars)|Janus]].{{Fn|1}}

Sangrill was part of a Black Templars task force active on [[Stygia XII]].  He was killed with the rest of his squadron when their [[Land Raider]], [[Escalade Three]], was destroyed in an ambush by [[Chaos Cultists]].{{Fn|1}}

