Sapphon.wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''Sapphon''' is the present [[Master of Sanctity|Grand Master of Chaplains]] and [[High Interrogator]]{{Fn|2}} in the [[Dark Angels]] [[Space Marine]] chapter. He also has the special title of ''Finder of Secrets''.{{Fn|1}}

It is said that Sapphon did not achieve his [[Dark Angels Grand Master|Grand Mastery]] from age or ability as an [[Interrogator-Chaplain|Interrogator]] ([[Asmodai]] is his superior in both these things) but due to his ability as an inspirational leader.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==

Sapphon was present for the interrogation of [[Astelan]] by [[Interrogator Chaplain]] [[Boreas (Dark Angel)|Boreas]]. He was in the interrogation chamber the entire time, but used a trick to misdirect Astelan's eyes and focus on other things to conceal his presence. At the end of his interrogation Astelan spoke of how the darkness within [[Lion El'Jonson]] was within all the dark angels, Boreas then stood up and asked Sapphon if he was done. Sapphon told Boreas he had done well, and earned a black pearl for his rosarius, revealing his presence to Astelan at last. He had two guards enter and restrain Astelan, then informed him that he would be brought to the deepest recesses of the rock, and hear [[Luther]]'s cries, confirming that he was still alive and held by the Dark Angels to Astelan. When asked why he was doing this he replied "Knowledge is power, guard it well."{{Fn|3}}

