Sarasti.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[daemon]] bound into a [[Daemonhost]] by [[Inquisitor]] [[Astor Sabbathiel]].{{fn|1}} Despite its bindings, it is able to communicate with one of the [[Fallen]] who seeks to turn the [[Dark Angels]] to [[Chaos]].{{fn|3}}

==History==
[[Image:Sarasti.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}} bound as a Daemonhost]]
'''Sarasti''' was bound into a [[Daemonhost]] kept in the hold of [[Inquisitor]] [[Astor Sabbathiel]]'s [[Inquisitorial Cruiser|ship]]. When she used the daemonhost to scry the future, it directed her to the [[Calaphrax Cluster]] where [[warp storm]]s that had raged for ten millennia were about to abate, warning her that the [[Dark Angels]] would seek to obscure the truth that might be revealed there.{{fn|1}}

While it directed Sabbathiel to a [[Chaos Cult]] on [[Quintus (Forest World)|Quintus]],{{fn|2}} Sarasti secretly communicated with one of the [[Fallen]] in the Cluster. The Fallen sought Sarasti's aid to turn the Dark Angels from the [[Emperor of Mankind|False Emperor]] to the way of [[Luther]], in exchange for which the daemonhost would receive a prize.{{fn|3}}

