Sass.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Sass''' is a [[Tempestus Scion]] of the [[Redemption Corps]] [[Imperial Guard Company|Company]], who serves as the [[Adjutant]] to its [[Tempestor Prime]] [[Zane Mortensen]].{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
He was born on [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] to a mother who was a [[Crystal Ersatz]] addict, which caused Sass to have prodigious mathematical abilities and indefatigable memory. After becoming a [[Stormtrooper]], Sass used this ability to become a bottomless pit of [[Tactica Imperium|Tactica]] protocol, field stratagems and strangely useful useless information. This made Sass an invaluable asset and when he joined the [[Redemption Corps]], this ability led him to become the perfect choice to be [[Zane Mortensen]]'s [[Adjutant]]. The [[Tempestor Prime]] would develop a soft spot for Sass, but he secretly thought the young [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromundan]] was wound tighter than tripwire.{{Fn|1a}} 

Despite the [[Redemption Corps]] being an air-mobile [[Imperial Guard Company|Company]], however, Sass never did combat drops due to his dislike of heights. He instead would his talents to coordinate the Redemption Corps' missions, and to come up with alternative strategies if need be, from within the aircraft they had jumped from.{{Fn|1b}}  

