Saul (Celestial Lions).wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
{{ambig|subject=Celestial Lion|disambiguation=Saul}}
'''Saul''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Celestial Lions]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
When [[Inquisitor]] [[Apollyon (Inquisitor)|Apollyon]] called on the aid of the Celestial Lions to help him crush the [[Khattarn Insurrection]], Saul acted as the [[Force Commander]], leading five [[Space Marine Company|companies]] of [[Space Marines]] to [[Khattar]] to put down the rebellion.{{Fn|1}}

Following the campaign, Apollyon purged the entire population of Khattar, claiming that the heresy that had taken root there had corrupted the populace. The Celestial Lions' officers denounced Apollyon, which led to the Chapter being systematically eliminated by the [[Inquisition]] as a message to those who would challenge their power.{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|Note 1}}


