Seena.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Seena''' was a [[Guardswoman]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Seena worked as a loom-girl in [[Vervunhive]]. When Vervunhive was [[Siege of Vervunhive|attacked]] by the [[Chaos|Fallen]] [[Hive]] [[Ferrozoica]] during the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]], she joined one of the [[Scratch Company]] militia formations to fight back against the Zoicans.{{Fn|1}}

Following the conclusion of the war, Vervunhive was reduced to a ruin. Seena was one of those scratch company soldiers to enlist with the [[Astra Militarum]], joining the Tanith First.{{Fn|1}} She became part of a [[Heavy Weapons Team]], handling the weapon itself while her fellow Guardswoman [[Arilla]] served as a loader.{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

Seena and Arilla almost died in a combat drop at [[Cirenholm]] on [[Phantine (Planet)|Phantine]] when their [[drop-ship]] was hit by anti-air fire and crash landed on the outside of Cirenholm's secondary dome. The two of them were carried off the edge of the dome when the remains of the drop-ship slid off it, but they were caught when their rope snagged on a vent. They were saved by [[Trooper]] [[Noa Vadim|Vadim]], who heard their calls for help and was able to get a rope to them.{{Fn|2}}

