Sefoni.wikitext:
{{OrdoHereticusPortal}}
'''Sefoni''' is a rare and formidable [[psyker]] in service to [[Inquisitor]] [[Grendyl]]. She has served the Inquisitor for a number of years and might know more secrets than even the Inquisitor's most trusted Interrogators.{{Fn|2}}

Sefoni is currently assisting the Inquisitor's warband aboard the ''[[Mourningstar]]'' via clairvoyant scrying of the going-ons within [[Hive]] [[Tertium]] and training the forces requisitioned by the Inquisition in the [[Psykhanium]].{{Fn|1b}} The [[Rogue Trader]], Shipmistress [[Emora Brahms|Brahms]] has even requested that Sefoni offer her training services in the Psykhanium to her [[voidsmen]] crew.{{Fn|1a}}

Sefoni is able to speak to individuals directly via [[telepathy]]. She is also able to alter the memories and even personalities of individuals, whether willing or not.{{Fn|1c}}{{Fn|1d}} The Barber-[[Chiurgeon|Chirurgeon]] of the warband, [[Oska Krall]], even works with her to offer a [[personality scourge]] service aboard the ''Mourningstar'', a service that can potentially rewrite an individual's recollection of their entire life's history. Sefoni affectionately refers to Oska as a creative genius and this service they offer as an artistic collaboration.{{Fn|1d}} This procedure requires the use of valuable [[prismata crystal]]s.{{Fn|3}} Although it isn't explicitly authorised by the Inquisitor, Interrogator [[Iven Rannick|Rannick]] allows it to continue since it might allow for a back door into the minds of their warband's rabble.{{Fn|1a}}

Sefoni has a playful and mischievous personality. She often refers to the warband's rabble as her "playthings" and enjoys watching them struggle and shed blood in the visions she conjures during [[psykhanium]] training sessions.{{Fn|1b}}

