Sehalla.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
'''Sehalla''' was an [[Imperial Navy Captain]] during the [[Plague of Unbelief]], on the side of [[Cardinal]] [[Bucharis]]. Bucharis met and joined with Sehalla on the planet [[Rhanda]] and they proceeded to conquer an empire together. He appeared to have a cautious mind, as he agreed with Bucharis when he was told to stop short of [[Bakka]] in fear of the empire being discovered by the [[Imperium]] and ordered the retreat from [[Fenris]] when the [[Space Wolves]]' fleet arrived.{{Fn|1}}

He protected his ships ahead of the other forces, and only dropped out of the [[warp]] to pick Bucharis up for the briefest amount of time before retreating again.{{Fn|1}}

His counterpart in the ground forces was [[Colonel]] [[Gasto]], who also met Bucharis on Rhanda.{{Fn|1}}

