Sei.wikitext:
'''[[Kor'la]] Sei Win'al''', simply known as '''Sei''' is a pilot of the [[Tau]] [[Air Caste]].{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
Sei is a skilled [[Barracuda]] and [[Orca]] pilot who is attached to his assistant [[Drone]]s, '''Daya-1''' and '''Daya-2'''. He was chosen to by the [[Ethereal]] [[Aun'ui Yor'i]] to take part in an [[Elemental Council]] for a special mission in the war for [[Cao Quo]] alongside the [[Fireblade]] [[Swordlight]], [[Earth Caste]] engineer [[Ke]], [[Water Caste]] operative [[Orr]], and the [[Gue'vesa]] agent [[Jules Rare]]. The group is is assigned to rescue the missing Ethereal [[Aun'ui Kir'qath]].{{Fn|1a}} 

During their subsequent mission, Sei grows close to most of the squad as they unravel a conspiracy involving the mysterious [[Syra]] group that spreads to the highest levels of Tau command which the rescued Kir'qath had discovered. The mission ultimately proves too much for Sei, particularly after Daya-1 is destroyed while Daya-2 is becoming corrupted. He is granted leave by Yor'i back to his regular air unit.{{Fn|1b}}

Later, Sei is part of the air attack on the human city of of Dai-Quo Magnus ordered by Yor'i. In truth, this Yor'i is a [[Callidus Assassin]] being used by the [[Raptors (Chapter)|Raptors]] to spread discontent and destabilize the [[Greater Good]]. He then receives a message from the true Yor'i, who was saved by the Humans, ordering that the attack be halted. He aborts the bombing mission of Dai-Quo even if it means defying orders, then forces his wingmen out of their own attack run. However, his Barracuda is then attacked by Imperial aircraft and shot down, killing him.{{Fn|1c}}

