Sendric.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Sendric''' is a [[Black Templars]] [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]], who wields the relic [[Bolt Pistol]] [[Penitent's Roar]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
Before he wielded it, though, the relic had been separated into pieces and scattered across the [[Galaxy]]. Sendric made it his quest to recover and resemble the [[Penitent's Roar]], which led him to face many trials. Among them were battles on [[Hegemnos]], [[Astricha]] and amidst the [[Benighted Peaks]]. He also lost an eye to an [[Aeldari]] sword, which was replaced by a [[Bionic eye|Bionic]]{{Fn|1b}}, and as a [[Castellan (Black Templars)|Castellan]] he cleansed a desecrated [[Imperial]] shrine, held by the [[Word Bearers]]{{Fn|1a}}. Once the pieces were all gathered, Sendric brought them to the [[Black Templars]] [[Techmarines]], who resembled and repaired the Penitent's Roar. The restored relic was then given to Sendric to wield and experienced a rapture of faith, as he held the blessed weapon. Since then, Sendric has wielded against the Imperium's enemies and it now feels like it is a part of him. The [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]] is currently leading his forces against a horde of [[Orks]] and easily killed the [[Xenos]]' [[Warboss|Warchief]] with a single shot from the [[Penitent's Roar]].{{Fn|1b}}

