Seneca.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
{{otheruses|USE=Ultramarine|OTHERUSE=[[Executioners]] [[Chapter Master]]|OTHERPAGE=Acas Seneca}}
'''Seneca''' was a [[Primaris Space Marine]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1b}}


==Biography==
Early in the [[Indomitus Crusade]], due to the Chapter's [[3rd Company (Ultramarines)|Third Company]] being delayed fighting a [[Chaos]] force in the [[Koryndil Reach]], [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Jorus Numitor|Numitor]] directed [[Chaplain]] [[Helios (Ultramarines)|Helios]] to command a mission to the planet [[Quradim]].{{Fn|1a}} Helios was given command of a contingent of Ultramarines, including Seneca, aboard the [[Destroyer]] ''[[Light of Iax]]''. To the Chaplain's shock, the Marines he was to command were [[Primaris Space Marine|giants]] clad in [[Tacticus Armour|an unfamiliar pattern of power armour]]. Seneca mollified Helios's concerns, however, by playing a holomessage recorded by the Ultramarines' [[Primarch]], [[Roboute Guilliman]].{{Fn|1b}}

==Unit==
Despite his lack of offical rank, Seneca was the informal leader of an [[Intercessor Squad]]. His fellow Intercessors ([[Ariston]], [[Caprico]], [[Kyros]] and [[Nicanor]]) referred to Seneca as '''"First"''', due to the fact that he was the first of the five of them to complete the Marines' training program on [[Mars]] and be placed into [[stasis]].{{Fn|1c}} Following the mission on Quradim, Seneca was formally promoted to the rank of [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] and inducted into the [[8th Company (Ultramarines)|Eighth Company]].{{Fn|1d}}

