'''Sentor Rahme''' was an officer in the [[Thousand Sons]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s [[Fellowship|Ninth Fellowship]], during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}
