Septic Lexus.wikitext:
{{NurglePortal}}
'''Septic Lexus''' is a [[Sorcerer]],{{Fn|2}} who serves within a large force{{Fn|1}} of [[Nurgle]]{{Fn|2}} [[Chaos Space Marines]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
After receiving a message from a trapped [[Great Unclean One]] on [[Tikgrix]],{{Fn|1}} Lexus{{Fn|2}} was chosen by the [[Chaos Space Marines]] he served to free{{Fn|1}} the [[Greater Daemon]].{{Fn|6}} The [[Sorcerer]] was then given command{{Fn|1}} of several [[Plague Marine]] squadrons and [[Nurgling]]s,{{Fn|2}} to ensure no one could stop him from doing so. However as they journeyed to Tikgrix,{{Fn|1}} Lexus's [[Chaos Warband|Warband]]{{Fn|2}} was secretly trailed by{{Fn|1}} the [[Ordo Malleus]] [[Inquisitor Lord]] [[Severus Oln]].{{Fn|3}} Both sides eventually reached Tikgrix, where the Inquisitor Lord had thought he would be facing a mere routine [[Chaos Cult]] purging. Soon though Oln began sensing the trapped [[Greater Daemon]] within his mind and realized at once, that neither he or his hastily gathered forces were prepared to face it. Instead the Inquisitor Lord resolved to stop Lexus from freeing the Great Unclean One and then a cell of Inquisitors or [[Grey Knight]]s would later deal with the Greater Daemon.{{Fn|1}} 

The two sides then clashed in the village where the [[Great Unclean One]]'s cube prison was located,{{Fn|5}} all while the [[Greater Daemon]] attacked their minds to dominate them. Unfortunately, many of [[Severus Oln|Oln]]'s forces fell under its sway and this greatly aided{{Fn|6}} [[Septic Lexus|Lexus]] in successfully freeing the [[Greater Daemon]], who became his new master. The [[Inquisitor Lord]] was then killed in battle with the [[Sorcerer]] and the newly freed [[Daemon]], who soon unleashed the forces of the [[Chaos God]] [[Nurgle]] upon the world. This led to the deaths of Oln's remaining retinue and the Great Unclean One{{Fn|5}} began to change Tikgrix into a [[Daemon World]], that it would rule over.{{Fn|1}} 

==Lexus' Forces==
*'''Personal Retinue''' - 2 Acolytes, 2 [[Combat Servitor]]s, 2 [[Hierophant]]s, 1 [[Familiar]]{{Fn|2}}
*'''Squad Plague''' - 10 [[Plague Marines]]{{Fn|2}} 
*'''Squad Pestilence''' - 10 Plague Marines{{Fn|2}} 
*'''Squad Famine''' - 6 Plague Marines{{Fn|2}} - KIA on [[Tikgrix]]{{Fn|4}}
*'''Squad Death''' - 5 Plague Marines{{Fn|2}}
*'''The Blessed Ones''' - 10 [[Nurgling]]s{{Fn|2}} 

==Trivia==
''Septic Lexus'' and his forces were created by the [[Games Workshop]] employee [[Jake Landis]] and they were featured on an older version of the company's website.{{Fn|2}}

