Serevakh.wikitext:
{{NecronsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''', known as the '''Star-Throned''', the '''Glorious''', and the '''Endless''', is a [[Necron Overlord]].{{Fn|1}}

{{PAGENAME}} is known for his pageantry and many victories. He razed the crystal bastions of [[Zephon Trinary]] with synchronized [[Transdimensional Beamer|Transdimensional]] strikes, then rebuilt it as his personal observatory. He outflanked an entire [[Eldar]] host by calculating their assault vectors three epochs in advance, engraving the prediction on his command dais for all to see. He chained a renegade [[C'tan shard]] in an infinite recursion prism, forcing it to power the stasis galleries that display his triumphs to any who dare an audience.{{Fn|1}}

He has since come to the world of [[Mordian]] due to the detection of a disturbance in the fabric of reality that could prove invaluable to any Necron can master it. As he landed, he encountered [[Trazyn the Infinite]], who captured him for his galleries on [[Solemnace]] and took his place with a proxy body and seeks the same power {{PAGENAME}} did.{{Fn|1}}

