{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
'''Seuitonius Thucidides Terryn''' was the [[High King]] of [[House Terryn]] during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
A descendant of Lord [[Brutus Terryn]], Seuitonius was head of his [[Knight House|Knightly House]] when the nascent [[Imperium of Mankind]] made contact with [[Voltoris]] during the Great Crusade. He pledged allegiance to the [[Emperor of Mankind|Emperor]] and House Terryn has fought valiantly for the Imperium ever since.{{Fn|1}}

He personally oversaw House Terryn's first campaigns on behalf of the Imperium, fighting alongside the [[Ultramarines]].{{Fn|1}}

