Seuitonius is possibly named for [[Wikipedia:Thucydides|Thucydides]], an ancient Greek historian and general and either [[Wikipedia:Gaius Suetonius Paulinus|Gaius Suetonius Paulinus]], an ancient Roman general notable for defeating a rebellion led by [[Wikipedia:Boudica|Queen Boudica]] of the Iceni, or for [[Wikipedia:Suetonius|Suetonius]], an ancient Roman historian.

