Seven Pale Spinners.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
{{ChaosPortal}}
The '''Seven Pale Spinners''' are among a number of [[Daemon]]s that some in the [[Underhive|depths]] of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[Hive Primus]] sometimes call upon.{{Fn|1}} 

Those facing death can desperately call upon them in order to live beyond their allotted life-span and the Daemons are able to grant that last wish for a price. Those marked by the Seven Pale Spinners, however, will be required to conduct [[human]] sacrifices to the Daemons in order to sustain their lives. In time, though, the powers granted by the Seven Pale Spinners will eventually turn their victims into [[Chaos Spawn]]s.{{Fn|1}}

