Severin Drask.wikitext:
{{CrimsonSlaughterPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Sorcerer Lord]] of the [[Crimson Slaughter]] [[Chaos Space Marine]]s.{{Fn|1}}

==History==
{{Spoiler|source=Assassinorum: Execution Force (Novel)}}
[[Image:Drask.jpg|thumb|right|220px|{{PAGENAME}}]]
Drask earned a notorious reputation for himself, purging entire star systems. He became known as cunning and cruel beyond the extreme, and this coupled with his formidable [[Psyker|psychic]] [[Pyromancer]] abilities made him a force to be reckoned with. His ultimate goal however was always to achieve [[Daemon Prince|Daemonhood]].{{Fn|1}}

Drask became the center of a desperate manhunt by the [[Imperium]] during the [[Thirteenth Black Crusade]] when the [[Primaris Psyker]] [[Lunst Cataboldine]] discovered his plans to commit the [[Achyllan Atrocity]], which could put [[Terra]] itself under threat from [[Abaddon the Despoiler]]. An [[Officio Assassinorum]] execution force was dispatched by the [[High Lords of Terra]] to find and eliminate Drask.{{Fn|1}}

Ultimately, the Execution Force, known as '''Operation Deathblow''', was successful in finding Drask on [[Achyllan Primaris]]. In a vicious battle, Drask was badly wounded and killed when the [[Eversor Assassin]] [[Sylas Torq]] detonated. [[Tzeentch]] lost his faith in Drask and withdrew his support, which resulted in the entire [[Temple of Shades]] collapsing with him.{{Fn|2}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Assassinorum: Execution Force (Game)]] Rulebook, pg. 21
*{{Endn|2}}: [[Assassinorum: Execution Force (Novel)]], Chapter 4

