[[File:Severus.jpg|thumb|right|Captain Severus of the Ultramarines]]
'''Severus''' was [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]] during its mission to [[Mithron]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
{{spoiler|source=Ultramarines - A Warhammer 40,000 Movie}}
Shortly after commencing the action that purged the [[Tyranid]] infestation on [[Algol]], Severus led a small squad of newly initiated Space Marines from the 2nd Company to [[Mithron]] to answer an [[Imperial Fists]]’ distress call from the 5th Company garrisoned there.{{Fn|1}}

Not long after [[Ultima Squad|Ultima Squad]] had made planetfall and skirmished with a contingent of [[Black Legion]] [[Chaos Space Marines]], the Ultramarines were attacked by a [[Chaos]] [[Daemon Prince]] who was leading the attack. Severus was presumably killed when he and the Daemon Prince toppled out of a high window, and fell down a deep chasm below.{{Fn|1}}

The Prince then tore away Severus's flesh and "wore" it as a disguise, to reunite with the Ultima Squad and infiltrate the [[Strike Cruiser]] that had delivered them to Mithron. It revealed its true nature, and was killed by [[Proteus]] before it could fulfill its plan to return with the rest of the survivors to [[Macragge]].{{Fn|1}}


