Severus Oln.wikitext:
{{OrdoMalleusPortal}}
'''Severus Oln''' was a [[Psychic]] [[Ordo Malleus]] [[Inquisitor Lord]].{{Fn|3}}
==History==
When he{{Fn|3}} began secretly trailing the{{Fn|1}} [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] of the [[Nurgle]] [[Sorcerer]] [[Septic Lexus]],{{Fn|2}} Oln hastily gathered a force to deal with the [[Traitors]]. The [[Inquisitor Lord]] stalked them from world to world, until the Warband reached [[Tikgrix]]. Though the [[Inquisitor Lord]] originally thought he would be dealing with a routine [[Chaos Cult]] purging, he soon began sensing{{Fn|1}} a [[Great Unclean One]]{{Fn|5}} within his mind. It was trapped within a cube prison in a village on Tikgrix, which Lexus intended to break open, and Oln realized at once, that he was not prepared to face{{Fn|1}} the [[Greater Daemon]].{{Fn|6}} Instead the Inquisitor Lord resolved to stop Lexus from freeing the Great Unclean One and then a cell of Inquisitors or [[Grey Knight]]s would later deal with the Greater Daemon.{{Fn|1}} 

The two sides then clashed in the village,{{Fn|5}} all while the [[Greater Daemon]] attacked their minds to dominate them. Unfortunately, many of Oln's forces fell under its sway and this greatly aided{{Fn|6}} [[Septic Lexus|Lexus]] in successfully freeing the [[Great Unclean One]]. The [[Inquisitor Lord]] was then killed in battle with the [[Sorcerer]] and the newly freed [[Daemon]], who soon unleashed the forces of the [[Chaos God]] [[Nurgle]] upon the world. This led to the deaths of Oln's remaining retinue and the Great Unclean One{{Fn|5}} began to change Tikgrix into a [[Daemon World]].{{Fn|1}} 

