Shadryss.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was an [[Imperial Fists]] [[Chaplain]] who journeyed to [[Terra]] as part of his duties to his [[Chapter]] to place the scrimshawed hands of his [[Battle Brother]]s in the [[Pillar of Bone]] monument. To those on Terra the Pillar of Bone is known as being dedicated to the Imperial Fists' courage during an unnamed campaign, but {{PAGENAME}}, who viewed the history of his Chapter as a sacred thing, knew its true history. It was in reality the last remnant of the Imperial Fists' once-great [[Fortress Monastery]], that was destroyed when Terra was [[Battle for Terra|invaded]] during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

As {{PAGENAME}} reached the Pillar of Bone however, he met a young pilgrim named [[Darnath Lysander]], who told the Chaplain of the dangerous journey he had just completed to reach Terra; a journey that had resulted in the death of his parents and nearly him as well. Once Lysander had completed his harrowing tale, {{PAGENAME}} knew at once that the boy being present at such a sacred site to the Imperial Fists, was a sign from his [[Primarch]] [[Rogal Dorn]] and immediately recruited Lysander as an [[Aspirant]] for his Chapter.{{Fn|1}}

