Sharden Nour.wikitext:
{{WordBearersPortal}}
'''Sharden Nour''' was a [[Dark Apostle]] of the [[Word Bearers]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], who took part in the [[Great Crusade]] and the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
He served under [[Kor Phaeron]] and was among the [[Word Bearers]]' forces that fought in the [[Dropsite Massacre]]. At that time, [[Phaeron]] considered Nour to be keen edged and that he had a soul that was pure of purpose. Just as the Massacre was about to begin, Nour informed Phaeron that the [[Raven Guard]] [[Master of Descent]] [[Alvarex Maun]] had refused to follow the general order he had been given. Instead of having the Raven Guard's aircraft return to orbit to rearm, after taking part in the first wave of the attack on [[Isstvan V]] with the other [[Loyalist]]s, Maun was keeping them nearby to further aid his [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]. However some of the aircraft would land until they were needed and Nour suggested that the [[Sightless Light]] encircle them. Phaeron agreed with Nour's advice, as any Raven Guard that tried to reach the aircraft to escape once the Massacre began, would need to fight their way through the Sightless Light first.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
