Shas'O Eirl'O'Vash.wikitext:
{{TauPortal}}
'''Shas'O Eirl'O'Vash''' is a [[Tau Commander|Commander]] in the [[T'au Empire]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He led its [[Fire Warriors]] that were part of the [[T'au Empire]]'s invasion of the [[Imperial]] [[Sector]]s near the [[Damocles Gulf]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]].{{Fn|1}} The invasion was part of the T'au's [[Third Sphere of Expansion]]{{Fn|2}} which was led by the [[Ethereal]] [[Mont'shi]], who Eirl'O'Vash was charged with aiding in the conquest. However, the Imperium would later launch the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Mont'shi Campaign]] against the invading [[Xenos]].{{Fn|1}} During the course of the Campaign, Eirl'O'Vash took part in the invasion of the Imperial world [[Draven III]], which turned into a stalemate. Mont'shi later aided the [[Tau Commander|Commander]] by giving him orders, via the [[Water Caste]] emissary [[Ori'priam]], that would counter the Imperial reinforcements the Ethereal learned were being sent to the embattled world.{{Fn|3}} Sometime later, the Mont'shi Campaign's Imperial forces were defeated by the T'au Empire and Eirl'O'Vash survived the conflict.{{Fn|1}}  

