Shas'O Vior'la Shalas.wikitext:
{{TauPortal}}
'''Shas'O Vior'la Shalas''', better known as '''Commander Swiftflame''', is a [[Tau Commander]]. He has often been compared to the infamous [[Commander Farsight]] in personality and strategic style.{{Fn|1}}

Born on the [[Sept]] of [[Vior'la]], Swiftflame specializes in speed, destruction, and dramatic hot-blooded warfare. He is infamous for his conviction and self-confidence, but is driven not by pride but by the doctrines of the [[Greater Good]]. Indeed, O'Shalas' greatest fear is that of failing in his duty. In his private moments, he will confide these thoughts to his [[Ethereal]] overseers but none else.{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Prefectia Campaign]], Swiftflame proved to be a master of deception and convincing his enemies that they had him at a disadvantage.{{Fn|1}}

