Shemvokh.wikitext:
{{NecronPortal}}
'''Shemvokh''' was the [[Phaeron]] of the [[Nihilakhi Dynasty]].{{Fn|1}}

True to his Dynasty's nature, Shemvokh is defensive and isolationist in nature. However he has nonetheless carried out the orders of the [[Silent King]] [[Szarekh]] and deployed troops to the [[Nephilim Sector]] to aid the [[War in the Pariah Nexus|Necron efforts there]]. His motivations are not loyalty to his liege however but rather the wealth, prestige, and territory promised to him by Szarekh.{{Fn|4}}

His [[Necron Dynasty|Dynasty]] was among the [[Xenos]]' forces defending the [[Pariah Nexus]] and he was charged with protecting the world [[Cherist]]{{Fn|1}}. However the [[Indomitus Crusade]]'s [[Battle Group Kallides]] later invaded the Nexus and Cherist was attacked by the [[Battle Sister]] [[Ephrael Stern]]'s forces. In the battle that followed, the [[Nihilakhi Dynasty]] was defeated and Shemvokh was destroyed by holy lightning cast down by Stern.{{Fn|1}}

Despite his apparent destruction, Shemvokh's body was merely destroyed and he was reincarnated into a new body by his [[Cryptek]]s. As his new form underwent construction he was forced to enact his will through lesser lords and [[Royal Warden]]s.{{Fn|1}}


