'''Sigurd''' was a [[Wolf Priest]] of the [[Space Wolves]] chapter.{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
{{Spoiler|source=Ragnar Blackmane: Saga of the Beast (Audio Drama)}}
Very little is known about Wolf Priest Sigurd. The only thing known about him is that [[Wolf Lord]] [[Ragnar Blackmane]] spoke with him about visions, which he saw after slaying a [[Maulerfiend]] of the remnant [[Thousand Sons]] army on [[Fenris]]. Later on, after consulting  and seeking advice from Wolf Priest, it was decided that Ragnar should travel the [[Underverse]] just as the [[Primarch]] [[Leman Russ (Primarch)|Leman Russ]] did many millennia before. After receiving another vision, consulting with the Wolf Priest, and obtaining permission from [[Great Wolf]] [[Logan Grimnar]], it was decided that Sigurd would accompany Ragnar in his search of the great beast from Ragnar's vision.{{Fn|1}}

After arriving in [[Krongar]] it turned out that the great beast to be slain is none other than the [[Ork]] [[Ork Warlord|Warlord]] [[Ghazghkull Mag Uruk Thraka]]. Sigurd died during the fight on Krongar with Orks, along with many battle-brothers of the Space Wolves chapter.{{Fn|1}}

