'''Sigvald Deathgranter''' is a [[Wolf Lord]] of the [[Space Wolves]] who played a key role in the [[Crusade of Fire]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
Initially battling [[Chaos Space Marines]] and [[Traitor Guard]] with his Space Wolves' force on the world of [[Junkatta]], Deathgranter was seemingly captured in a later battle against [[Dark Eldar]] on [[Alfrost]] after killing a [[Succubus]]. However, Sigvald would later manage to escape his captors and returned to Imperial lines to lead the Space Wolves in the Crusade once more.{{Fn|1}}

At some unknown time Sigvald underwent the [[Rubicon Primaris]] procedure.{{Fn|2}} His [[Bladeguard Veteran]] [[Wolfguard]] are known as the '''Jarlsguard''', which Deathgranter's [[Battle Leader]] [[Kalf Wyrmblade]] is a member of. Equipped with [[Frost Blade]]s and [[Storm Shield]]s, they form an impenetrable shield wall around the [[Wolf Lord]] during battles. The Jarlsguard also serve as his drinking companions.{{Fn|3}}
