Silas Alberec.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[3rd Company (Exorcists)|3rd Company]] of the [[Exorcists]] [[Space Marine Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

==Overview==
A mighty warrior with [[Ogryn]]-like stature, he has become a legend within the Chapter.  As a [[Neophyte]], Alberec was assigned to a small strike force assisting [[Ordo Malleus]] [[Inquisitor]] [[Khazan]] against a [[Daemonic]] infestation on the [[Mars Class Battlecruiser]] ''[[Sundered Star]]''.  When the ship phased into the [[Warp]] suddenly, the nightmarish realm flooded the ship and Imperial casualties were enormous.  Silas Alberec was one of the few to survive, dragging the maimed Inquisitor to a lifepod before the vessel disappeared forever.  This act of courage helped earn him his current Captain rank.  In addition, he holds the titles of '''Keeper of Vigils''' and adjutant of the Orison of the Broken Tower, one of the few non-[[Psyker]]s to achieve such a status.{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Badab War]], Silas Alberec commanded the Exorcists contingent, where he gained great fame in several engagements.  These include taking the armed merchantman ''[[Soyuz-Maru]]'' and leading the attack on '''Sentinel-Sigma Station''' during the fall of [[Badab]].  During this battle he slew the [[Chaplain]] [[Arkil Lionsmane]] in personal combat.  However, his reputation suffered when several [[Astral Claws]] rebel ships were able to escape the Exorcists Blockade.{{Fn|1}}

==Wargear==
In battle, Alberec wields a massive barbed and sigil-etched two-handed power-mace, the '''[[Hellslayer]]'''.{{Fn|1}}

