Sindri Myr.wikitext:
{{AlphaLegionPortal}}
[[Image:Sorcerer.jpg|thumb|right|Alpha Legion Sorcerer Sindri Myr]]
'''Sindri Myr''' was an [[Alpha Legion]] [[Sorcerer]]. He was Lord [[Bale (Chaos Lord)|Bale]]'s advisor during Alpha Legion's search for the [[Maledictum]], and by his careful scheming the [[Orks]] of the planet were used to buy time for the Chaos forces to complete their search. During the search he tainted the [[Blood Ravens]] [[Librarian]] [[Isador Akios]] with taunts of how he might use the Maledictum for his own victory against Chaos. Eventually, Isador succumbed to the lure of Chaos and was executed by his old friend and Blood Ravens' Captain [[Gabriel Angelos]].

Later, when the sacrificing of more lives and time was necessary, Sindri tricked Lord Bale into combat with Angelos, who slew Bale. Sindri escaped the confrontation, and eventually made himself into a [[Daemon Prince]] with the power of the Maledictum. He was soon defeated, however, by the Blood Ravens.{{Fn|1}}

In his mortal form he had access to numerous [[Chaos Psychic Powers]] and was armed with a [[Bedlam Staff]].{{Fn|1}}


