Sisenna.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Sisenna''' is an [[Ultramarines]] [[Chaplain]], who served in the [[Indomitus Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
He was among a [[Space Marine Company|Company]] worth of [[Ultramarines]] sent to defend [[Cassothea]], during the [[Indomitus Crusade|Crusade]]. The world lays within the [[Pariah Nexus]] and was being invaded by hordes of [[Necron]], which vastly outnumbered the Ultramarines. Though the Crusade's command had ordered that Cassothea could not fall to the [[Xenos]], the war went badly quickly. Within only days of arriving there, the senior of the two [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]]s leading the Company was killed by the Necrons and Lieutenant [[Falerius]] took command of the Company. He ordered the Ultramarines to focus on saving Cassothea's capital city, '''Macuth''', but months later, the Necron had destroyed most of it. Many of the city's population had been massacred as well, along with over half of the Ultramarines. With no way to stop the Necron hordes from repairing themselves and with the last Crusade supply ship crashing into Cassothea, the order was given to evacuate the world. Soon afterwards, Falerius would be killed by the Necron, but the Lieutenant had told Sisenna before hand, that upon his death that [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Allectius]] was to take command. This surprised Allectius, after the [[Chaplain]] told him, as [[Fulgentius]] was the most senior of the surviving Sergeants. Sisenna confirmed it, though, and stated the other Sergeants had agreed to abide by the late Falerius' wishes.{{Fn|1}} 

==Sources==
