Skalagrim Phar.wikitext:
{{BlackLegionPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Apothecary]] from the [[Sons of Horus]].{{Fn|1a}}

Originally serving [[Horus]] and later [[Abaddon]] as a [[Reaver Attack Squad|Reaver]], during the fall of [[Maleum]] Skalagrim defected and joined [[Fabius Bile]]'s [[Consortium]]. Despite his status as an apothecary, he retains his savage [[Cthonia]]n nature and his surgeries are brutal affairs.{{Fn|1a}} Though he seems to have a degree of hatred for Bile, Skalagrim remained loyal to the [[Chief Apothecary]] during the treachery of [[Flavius Alkenex]]. During the fighting on [[Solemnace]], he saved the life of [[Mayshana]], one of Bile's most prized [[Gland Hound]]s.{{Fn|1b}}

Skalagrim parted ways with Fabius before his apparent death at the [[Battle of Belial IV]], but later entered the employ of the [[Black Legion]] and was shocked to discover the Chief Apothecary was still alive in the form of clones. Phar informed Fabius of [[Belisarius Cawl]]'s [[Primaris Space Marine]]s, and stated [[Abaddon]] expected him to create new monsters as a response. He then watched as the "primary" Fabius was reawakened from stasis by [[Melusine]].{{Fn|2}}

