Solomon Akurra.wikitext:
{{AlphaLegionPortal}}
'''Solomon Akurra''' is an [[Alpha Legion]] [[Chaos Lord]]{{Fn|1}} and [[Harrowmaster]]{{Fn|4}}, who commands the [[Serpent's Teeth]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]].{{Fn|2}}

==History==
[[Image:Akurra.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}} with the [[Pale Spear]]{{Fn|2e}}]]
Solomon Akurra was able to wrest control of the Serpent's Teeth after the death of his predecessor [[Drazus Jate]], and also has come to possess the [[Star Fort]] ''[[Unseen (Space Hulk)|Unseen]]''. While most Alpha Legion commanders confine themselves to shadow and stealth, Solomon Akurra is a bold strategic leader who proactively takes the fight to the Imperium. He is known to have entire [[System]]s into swearing fealty to his forces through threats, trickery, and deceit.{{Fn|4}}

In [[M42]], Solomon Akurra sought to reclaim the precious Alpha Legion artefact known as the [[Pale Spear]], which was once wielded by [[Alpharius]] himself. The spear had moved to an [[Ordo Malleus]] vault in the [[Psyphos Sub-Sector]] by command of [[Inquisitor]] [[Kayzen Hart]], in order to lure the traitor Astartes into an ambush.{{Fn|2b}} While Solomon was able to retrieve the blades of the Spear{{Fn|2c}} and use them to wrest back control of the conglomerated Alpha Legion [[Chaos Warband]]s of the [[Ultima Segmentum]], the original haft remains in Inquisitor Hart's hands.{{Fn|2d}} Solomon now commands a coalition of Alpha Legion warbands dubbed the '''Ghost Legion'''. He now has the majority of the [[Psyphos Sub-Sector]] in [[Segmentum Pacificus]].{{Fn|4}}

Solomon Akurra is known to recruit [[human]] [[Operative|operatives]] and legionaries from loyalist [[Schola Progenia]], often without the knowledge of the recruits or the schola.{{Fn|3}} He is also accompanied by a human [[witch]] [[Tulava Dyne]].{{Fn|2a}}

